      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I think I can be of some help to you.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Dennar\u0027s Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My Barbarians will lead you to victory.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Furren\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My wares can help you in your quest.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gunrha",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Every child trembles at the hearing of this most infamous name. This lord of hell is known for his blood thirsts. It is said that he once ate 1000 slaves at a banquet given by Bethrezen for a victory against the kingdom of light.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lantfrid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Highest lord of the dwarf lords, he is known for his intensity in battle and his courage in the face of overwhelming odds. He once fought seven days and nights against the mighty red dragon ARFURUZON to finally defeat him.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zaorish",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kraken",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wizard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lightning Attack",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Angel of Mercy \n\u0022Begone! None shall enter Bitter Bliss and disturb us on our mission to help Prowess achieve peace. Praise the Mourning Star!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Healing Grounds",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Highfather Blessing",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vinusi Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vinusi Knight \n\u0022Very well, I would rather tell you than the demons. The Highfather statue nearby is a Celestial land mark. Once you are near, the Celestial healing shall begin. The Angels Of Mercy are strong and this landmark can be very helpful.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rock Castle Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Brave Knight  \n\u0022North of here is a burial ground where the Undead roam free. The burial ground is a Celestial landmark. By entering the burial ground, the Celestial healing will begin.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Final Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Askael \n\u0022As the Angels of Mercy fall to our fiery might, the people of Prowess will be enslaved and everything they love will burn!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Winning Condition",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \nIt is now Devil\u0027s Night in Prowess! The once prosperous and gentle region is now a land of chaos and fire. The citizens of Prowess have become slaves and soldiers for the Legions Of The Damned!",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Island of Virago",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022The island of Virago is heavily protected by the Orcs. The Orcs are believed to have a large supply of gold. It shouldn\u0027t be too difficult to claim it from these dim-witted beasts.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022Prowess has been taken over by the Angels of Mercy. The Angels believe in easing conflict through control. From the tower of Bitter Bliss, the Angels prepare to combat the upcoming ritual.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mc Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Prowess has stopped all trade with neigboring territories. We control a number of cities that depend upon trade with Prowess. Economic instability threatens to destroy our territories.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN0036",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wizard Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sympathizing Wizard \n\u0022Why do you fight against the will of all that is good? Devil\u0027s Night is upon us and we must unite to defeat the Heretic forces once and for all. By opposing us you have joined them! I will strike you down!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire \n\u0022Stop! The Angels have cleansed this area and you are not to set foot here!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vinusi II",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vinusi knight \n\u0022Please, don\u0027t stab me again, I will tell you all that I know. What statue? AGH! Yes! Yes...the statue will heal anyone - even the likes of you Heretics...please, just let me die.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S213SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S213UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    }
  ]
}